| Distributed systems | Distributed training, GPU utilization, autoscaling, circuit breakers | Proficient |
| Governance | Symphony 3-tier autonomy model, AI SDLC policy, PIR process | Expert (operational) |

### 3.2 Required — Domain-Specific (Atlassian Ecosystem)

