Overlaps (notably guardrails appearing in both worker_1 and worker_2) have been merged into §10.5. The AI-native execution philosophy from worker_2 has been propagated throughout — into responsibilities (§2), competencies (§3.4), evaluation standards (§4.2), KPIs (§8), and day-one tasks (§11.3) — so that the document specifies an AI-level operating standard end-to-end, not just in the AI-philosophy section.
