4. **Run a proactive data-quality audit** — feature coverage by connector / region / tenant for owned models; surface sparsity issues before they appear in training. Confirms proactive workflow [W2 §3.3].
5. **Execute one drift-triggered retrain** end-to-end under SOP-1 in 🟡 mode (human confirms deploy). Confirms readiness for 🟢 promotion on that workflow.
6. **Author or refresh SLOs + SignalFx detectors as code** for one owned endpoint. Confirms reliability-engineering competency.

Successful completion of these tasks, with clean reasoning traces and zero policy violations, is the **gate for promotion from L1/L2 to L3 conditional autonomy** on the owned model program.

